WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.208
The two brass rings sit at different points along the key.

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:04.792
The front slot clears its ward. The rear slot is too shallow and the bolt stays still.

00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:06.125
The fuller bit comes out. Both brass wards stay in the case.

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:08.167
The narrow strip passes inside both rings. Its working tip turns beyond them.

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:09.500
The tip pushes the talon on the bolt until the bolt head clears the keeper.
